A(E("黄脸油葫芦","Emma Field Cricket","Teleogryllus emma","田间、地头及墙缝","取食植物嫩芽和昆虫","体长约2厘米","0.3-0.6克",0.02,"无危(LC)","🦗","体黑褐色,头面部黄色,两雄相遇会激烈搏斗,鸣声油亮圆润,俗称油葫芦,是民间斗蟋的主要种类之一,常见于田间地头。","A photorealistic macro photograph of an Emma Field Cricket (Teleogryllus emma), dark brown field cricket with a yellow face, on soil near a field ridge, National Geographic style."))
