A(E("金铃","Japanese Bell Cricket","Homoeogryllus japonicus","草丛及灌木丛","取食植物嫩叶","体长约1.5厘米","0.1-0.3克",0.015,"无危(LC)","🦗","小型蟋蟀,体色金黄,鸣声清脆悦耳如铃声,是鸣虫爱好者珍爱的品种,栖息于草丛,夜间鸣叫,体型小巧玲珑。","A photorealistic macro photograph of a Japanese Bell Cricket (Homoeogryllus japonicus), tiny golden bell cricket on a grass blade at night, National Geographic style."))
A(E("华北蝼蛄","Northern Mole Cricket","Gryllotalpa unispina","农田土壤及湿润地带","取食作物根系和种子","体长约4.5厘米","3-5克",0.045,"无危(LC)","🦗","体黄褐色,前足特化为开掘足如铲子,在地下挖掘隧道,取食作物根系和种子,是重要地下害虫,有趋光性,夜间飞出地面。","A photorealistic macro photograph of a Northern Mole Cricket (Gryllotalpa unispina), large yellowish-brown mole cricket with shovel-like front legs, on freshly dug soil, National Geographic style."))
A(E("中华蚱蜢","Oriental Long-headed Grasshopper","Acrida cinerea","田野、荒地及路边","取食禾本科植物叶片","体长约6厘米","2-4克",0.06,"无危(LC)","🦗","体绿色或黄褐色,头呈锥形向前突出,后足发达善跳,是田野最常见的蚱蜢,取食禾本科植物叶片,飞行时发出噼啪声。","A photorealistic macro photograph of an Oriental Long-headed Grasshopper (Acrida cinerea), green long-headed grasshopper with a cone-shaped head, on a rice paddy leaf, National Geographic style."))
