A(E("棉蝗","Rose-winged Grasshopper","Chondracris rosea","南方棉区及灌丛","取食棉花等作物叶片","体长约6厘米","3-6克",0.06,"无危(LC)","🦗","大型蝗虫,体黄绿色,后翅基部玫瑰红色,飞行时如红花飞舞,取食棉花等作物叶片,是南方棉区的重要害虫,体型硕大。","A photorealistic macro photograph of a Rose-winged Grasshopper (Chondracris rosea), large green grasshopper with rosy-red hindwings, wings spread in flight over a cotton field, National Geographic style."))
A(E("黄脊竹蝗","Yellow-spined Bamboo Locust","Ceracris kiangsu","竹林及山地草丛","取食竹叶","体长约4.5厘米","2-4克",0.045,"无危(LC)","🦗","体黄绿色,前胸背板中央有黄色纵脊,是竹林的重要害虫,大发生时成千上万取食竹叶,可造成竹林大片枯黄。","A photorealistic macro photograph of a Yellow-spined Bamboo Locust (Ceracris kiangsu), yellow-green bamboo locust with a yellow mid-dorsal ridge, on bamboo leaves, National Geographic style."))

# ============ 蜻蜓目 (6) ============
A(E("红蜻","Scarlet Skimmer","Crocothemis servilia","池塘、湖泊等水域","捕食蚊蝇等小型飞虫","体长约4厘米","0.5-1克",0.04,"无危(LC)","🪰","雄虫全身鲜红色,翅脉红色,雌虫黄褐色,是最常见的红色蜻蜓,常停栖在水边枯枝上,捕食蚊蝇等小型飞虫,是秋日水塘的标志。","A photorealistic macro photograph of a Scarlet Skimmer (Crocothemis servilia), bright scarlet dragonfly with red wing veins, perching on a withered twig by a pond, National Geographic style."))
